<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico placed $300 mln dlr put options.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico placed $300 mln dlr put options.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's central bank said on Wednesday it had placed all $300 million dollar put options offered in an auction.</p>
<p>Banco de Mexico said in a statement it sold the options at a premium of 14.38 pesos per $1,000.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9565))</p>
</text>
